{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301340","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230134001:1":{"text":"항로가 봉쇄됐을 때보다 많아졌지만, 시내의 여관에 비하면...","source_cn":"和封锁时比确实多了不少，但和城里的旅店比起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A5F7B514DCF79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230134002:1":{"text":"보르스 여관의 손님이 제 가게보다 많은 거 같더라고요.","source_cn":"比如波尔斯旅店里的客人，就比我的店多了不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA77F46292E4247A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230134003:1":{"text":"방법을 생각해봐야 할 것 같아요. 더는 손님을 빼앗길 수 없어요.","source_cn":"我得想想办法，不能就这么看着他抢走我的客人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC53CF4229F5BEE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅店老板艾瑞特":{"text":"주점 사장 아레트","source":"旅店老板艾瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}